    "name": "OmniGateway API",
    "description": "Complete collection for every implemented OmniGateway HTTP route. Import `OmniGateway.local.postman_environment.json`, run Setup or Login first so Postman stores the admin cookie, create a gateway key, then call `/v1/*`. OAuth callback request is a browser-facing diagnostic route; normal provider redirects invoke it automatically. Raw gateway keys are captured from Create API Key and exist only once.",
